{"id":77,"date":"2016-03-02T12:31:15","date_gmt":"2016-03-02T18:31:15","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/jacksonparkwatch.org\/?p=77"},"modified":"2016-03-21T23:32:23","modified_gmt":"2016-03-22T04:32:23","slug":"jackson-park-is-not-for-profit-hyde-park-herald-march-2-2016","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/jacksonparkwatch.org\/2016\/03\/jackson-park-is-not-for-profit-hyde-park-herald-march-2-2016\/","title":{"rendered":"Jackson Park is not for profit (Hyde Park Herald &#8211; March 2, 2016)"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>To the Editor:<\/p>\n<p>Jackson Park is a sanctuary. It is a haven. Jackson Park is everyone\u2019s Sanctuary. Jackson Park is not for profit. It is not for anyone\u2019s exploitation.<\/p>\n<p>My highest priority is the protection and preservation of the Wooded Island, the bird sanctuary and the Bowling Green. For 50 years I have cared about Jackson Park. Also, Jackson Park is in the midst of a quiet residential area.<\/p>\n<p>Benign neglect is far preferable to the 120 Project encroachment or any project of its ilk.<\/p>\n<p>Thank you for your attention and concern.<\/p>\n<p>Sincerely,<br \/>\nKathie Newhouse<\/p>\n<p>Original link:\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/hpherald.com\/2016\/03\/02\/jackson-park-is-not-for-profit\/\">http:\/\/hpherald.com\/2016\/03\/02\/jackson-park-is-not-for-profit\/<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>To the Editor: Jackson Park is a sanctuary. It is a haven. Jackson Park is everyone\u2019s Sanctuary. Jackson Park is not for profit. It is not for anyone\u2019s exploitation. My highest priority is the protection and preservation of the Wooded Island, the bird sanctuary and the Bowling Green. For 50 years I have cared about [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":[],"categories":[4],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/jacksonparkwatch.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/